### 电影订票系统 — 手动测试主线（全部经网关 http://localhost:8180）
### 启动顺序：compose up -d → discovery → gateway → movie → booking → payment → simulator

### 0. 基础设施与服务健康
GET http://localhost:8762/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

###
GET http://localhost:8180/actuator/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. 目录浏览（movie-service）
### 影片列表
GET http://localhost:8180/api/v1/movies?city=北京

### 场次列表
GET http://localhost:8180/api/v1/movies/1/shows?city=北京

### 座位图（3 秒缓存，参考快照非权威判定）
GET http://localhost:8180/api/v1/shows/1/seats

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. 占座（hold）— 座位 ID 见座位图返回；不同用户换 userId 与 idempotencyKey
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/bookings/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": 1,
  "seatIds": [101, 102, 103],
  "userId": 1001,
  "idempotencyKey": "hold-demo-1001-a"
}

### 双击重放（同 userId + 同 idempotencyKey）→ 必须返回同一 booking
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/bookings/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": 1,
  "seatIds": [101, 102, 103],
  "userId": 1001,
  "idempotencyKey": "hold-demo-1001-a"
}

### 他人抢同座位 → 预期 409 SEAT_TAKEN
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/bookings/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": 1,
  "seatIds": [101, 102],
  "userId": 1002,
  "idempotencyKey": "hold-demo-1002-a"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. 支付（scenario 控制 mock 网关行为）
### NORMAL：UPI 延迟约 2 秒后成功回调，booking 自动 CONFIRMED
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/bookings/{{reference}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1001,
  "channel": "UPI",
  "scenario": "NORMAL",
  "idempotencyKey": "pay-demo-1001-a"
}

### DUPLICATE：连发 5 次相同 webhook，仅一次生效（看 booking-service 日志）
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/bookings/{{reference}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1003,
  "channel": "CARD",
  "scenario": "DUPLICATE",
  "idempotencyKey": "pay-demo-1003-a"
}

### FAIL：支付失败 → 座位立即释放、booking FAILED
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/bookings/{{reference}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1004,
  "channel": "UPI",
  "scenario": "FAIL",
  "idempotencyKey": "pay-demo-1004-a"
}

### LATE：迟到回调（默认 7 秒后回调；booking-service 以 HOLD_TTL_SECONDS=5 启动才构成"迟到"）
###   → 落在 60 秒宽限窗口内：尝试回收座位并确认
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/bookings/{{reference}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1005,
  "channel": "UPI",
  "scenario": "LATE",
  "idempotencyKey": "pay-demo-1005-a"
}

### LOST：回调丢失 → 支付停留在 UNKNOWN；用状态同步端点显式查询解锁
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/bookings/{{reference}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1006,
  "channel": "UPI",
  "scenario": "LOST",
  "idempotencyKey": "pay-demo-1006-a"
}

### 显式同步支付状态（webhook 丢失时的唯一正道：查询，绝不假设）
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/bookings/{{reference}}/payments/{{gatewayRef}}/sync

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. 查询
### 预订详情
GET http://localhost:8180/api/v1/bookings/{{reference}}?userId=1001

### 座位图（确认后对应座位变 BOOKED）
GET http://localhost:8180/api/v1/shows/1/seats

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. 运营看板（booking-service）
### 竞态汇总：oversellDetected 必须恒为 0
GET http://localhost:8180/api/v1/admin/metrics/race-summary

### 手动触发过期清扫（平时由调度器每 5 秒执行）
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/admin/expiry/sweep

### Outbox 统计（PENDING/PROCESSING/PUBLISHED/FAILED）
GET http://localhost:8180/api/v1/admin/outbox/stats

### 死信重放
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/admin/outbox/replay

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. 并发模拟（simulator，绕过网关直连 booking-service 测真实竞态）
### 50 人同时抢同 4 个座位：succeeded 必须 = 1，conflicts = 49，oversellDetected = 0
POST http://localhost:8194/api/v1/simulator/race
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": 1,
  "seatIds": [201, 202, 203, 204],
  "concurrency": 50,
  "staggerMs": 50
}

### 再跑一次看板，验证 oversellDetected 仍为 0
GET http://localhost:8180/api/v1/admin/metrics/race-summary
